Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start") -> action(n2,"Is input a URN or URL?") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n3,"Resolve URN to domain-name") -> converge(c1) -> action(n8,"Again check if the input is a URN or a URL") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> converge(c2) -> action(n5,"Link to designated DS and end") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start") -> action(n2,"Is input a URN or URL?") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n7,"Continue with the process") -> converge(c1) -> action(n8,"Again check if the input is a URN or a URL") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n4,"Send DNS query") -> action(n6,"Receive a list of URLs") -> converge(c2) -> action(n5,"Link to designated DS and end") -> end(e1)